{"type":"standard","title":"Vivek Ramaswamy","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Vivek Ramaswamy</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q27881473","titles":{"canonical":"Vivek_Ramaswamy","normalized":"Vivek Ramaswamy","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Vivek Ramaswamy</span></span>"},"pageid":52286158,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Vivek_Ramaswamy_%2855241367373%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Vivek_Ramaswamy_%2855241367373%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/Vivek_Ramaswamy_%2855241367373%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2348,"height":3128},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378149051","tid":"2c94d22b-bee3-11f1-9a2d-58a5c10404f6","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:30:34Z","description":"American entrepreneur and politician (born 1985)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivek_Ramaswamy","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivek_Ramaswamy?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivek_Ramaswamy?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Vivek_Ramaswamy"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivek_Ramaswamy","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Vivek_Ramaswamy","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivek_Ramaswamy?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Vivek_Ramaswamy"}},"extract":"Vivek Ganapathy Ramaswamy is an American entrepreneur and politician. He founded Roivant Sciences, a biotechnological pharmaceutical company, in 2014 and was its chief executive officer until 2021. Ramaswamy entered national politics as the youngest presidential candidate in the 2024 Republican primaries, but withdrew his bid and endorsed Donald Trump. He is currently the Republican nominee for governor of Ohio in the 2026 gubernatorial election and has been endorsed by both Trump and the Ohio Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Vivek Ganapathy Ramaswamy</b> is an American entrepreneur and politician. He founded Roivant Sciences, a biotechnological pharmaceutical company, in 2014 and was its chief executive officer until 2021. Ramaswamy entered national politics as the youngest presidential candidate in the 2024 Republican primaries, but withdrew his bid and endorsed Donald Trump. He is currently the Republican nominee for governor of Ohio in the 2026 gubernatorial election and has been endorsed by both Trump and the Ohio Republican Party.</p>"}